ent-ClothingHeadStrawHat = straw hat
    .desc = It's scratchy and rustic, but at least it keeps the sun off your head while you toil in the fields.

ent-ClothingHeadBandana = bandana
    .desc = A simple triangular length of fabric, typically worn tied around the head as decoration, or to constrict long hair during intensive work.

ent-ClothingHeadChaperon = chaperon hat
    .desc = A utilitarian yet fashionable hat traditionally made from a hood. Usually worn as a status symbol.

ent-ClothingHeadFisherhat = straw hat
    .desc = A hat worn by fishermen to protect from the sun.

ent-ClothingHeadKnitcap = knit cap
    .desc = A simple knitted cap.

ent-ClothingHeadTricorn = tricorn
    .desc = A triangular hat with its brim turned in on itself. Quite a new-fangled design, but one gaining popularity among sailors in particular.

ent-ClothingHeadTurban = turban
    .desc = A long, continuous strip of cloth that is wrapped around the top of a persons head. It is worn mostly in the southern reaches of Psydonia.

ent-ClothingHeadWitch = witch hat
    .desc = Fair is foul, and foul is fair; Hover through the fog and filthy air.

ent-ClothingHeadArmingCap = cap
    .desc = A light cap made of cloth, usually worn under a helmet.
